n is carried out, she can become an absolute safe person. Although she has to enter the room again, she is completely free until the police finish their investigation. Just wait for a while. As Miss Akagi Futaba, she can come out whenever she wants.\" [3898] \"If we and Nishiyama didn't come to the research institute, it would have been like that.\" Kurosu stopped and stood there, \"If we hadn't come, Dr. Akagi Akane would have been considered dead. So, our arrival was unexpected by Dr. Akagi, and it was a very troublesome problem. Becoming Miss Akagi Futaba and entering the guest room, Dr. Akagi was probably considering how to escape the research institute at that time. She entered the system and collected a lot of information. She was also listening to everyone's conversation. But she could also use the phone to call the boat at any time. That's because she knew the cause of Red Magic's abnormality. At that time, she saw the email sent by Ms. Shima saying that she would meet the magazine people. As a super user of Red Magic that Dr. Akagi herself developed, she saw the email sent to Ms. Shima and Mr. Yanez. To escape from the island, using that boat would be enough. The police hadn't started their actions yet...\"\n[3899] \"After leaving the island on that boat, as long as the police don't come, everything will be fine. Dr. Akagi, who fought for freedom, could realize all her plans.\" [3900] \"But Mr. Yanez discovered it unexpectedly. He watched the video of the interview with Dr. Akagi by Ms. Nishiyama a month ago. Then, he heard the part about B and D being lonely. All of it became F's information, and the story of B and D became a simple hint. He checked the source code of Red Magic... At least, he was in an environment more favorable than mine, and he could discover it earlier. Mr. Yanez realized that the series of abnormalities in the system were designed by Dr. Akagi as a Trojan horse. Then, it was just a\n[3901] \"Making the wise decision to abandon the Red