f any patches being made to Red Magic.\" [1033] \"Patches?\" asked Mori immediately. [1034] \"It's a change to a part of the program. I checked, and there's no trace of any changes. So... it can't be repaired. But there's no problem anywhere... Regardless, it's impossible to do it from Dr. Arakawa's room.\" [1035] \"So it must be one of the researchers here, then?\" said Mori bluntly. [1036] \"That's possible, at least.\" Ms. Oshima agreed, \"There's a possibility of that.\" [1037] \"The killer of Dr. Akita is someone inside this research institute.\" Miyuki continued, \"It's impossible for outsiders to come in\u2026\"\n[1038] \"That's right.\" Ms. Oshima nodded, \"We all have suspicions when the police come.\" [1039]6\n[1040] Mr. Sukiyama glanced at his watch, it was 2 a.m. Miyuki sat in the chair, looking sleepy. [1041] The new chief scientist, Shinobu, had been down to the second underground level for over twenty minutes. [1042] \"Have you contacted the police?\" asked Kusanagi, glancing at his watch with concern.\n <Assistant> I have read the book and I will answer the question you ask.\n\nPassage 9:\nDialogue between User and Assistant 2026-06-12 03:47:35 \\n<User> The following context is the book I have read: \n[3510] \"Ms. Shikata\u2026\" Shuig\u01d4's voice trembled. \"Are you\u2026Dr. Makoto Shikata? Alive\u2026why?\u2026\"\n[3511] \"Doctor Kugaya... \" Akita Shikiri turned to Doctor Kugaya, \"Where is your wife?\" [3512] \"Ah... She's sleeping.\" [3513] \"Thank your wife for being too kind to me. Please convey my greetings to her.\" [3514] Then, Akita Shikiri turned to Aoyama Yuki. [3515] \"Aunt... \" Shikiri slowly said, \"I had a lot of fun playing at Aunt's hospital. The nurses were very nice. We played hide-and-seek... and... rolled the glass balls down the long corridor. Do you remember?\" [3516] \"Yes... truly... Shinobu-san?\" [3517] \"Aunt is so much kinder than Dad and Mom...,\" Shinobu Shiki continued, \"I only have Aunt now...\"\n[3518] Shinobu