ple in the picture, and it seemed that their own voices could be heard by the other side. [3558] Now they were floating in the clouds. [3559] The dolls with the faces of Sugawara and Momiji were driving something that looked like a model car. Others were doing the same. Just as everyone was gathered in a circle for a meeting, a woman in a white model car descended. [3560] Everyone said it was Akari Shion. [3561] Initially, Zhi-chi sees this scene on the screen and secretly laughs at West Garden Department Head. [3562] \"Isn't this a bit over the top?\" Zhi-chi whispers to the Department Head. [3563] \"Do you think it's a prank?\" West Garden Department Head whispers back. [3564] \"Is it the killer?\" Zhi-chi replies, \"I don't think they have enough time for that.\" [3565] A young detective brings them tea. [3566] Zishizhou placed his index finger on his nose, making a shushing gesture. The subordinate detective retreated with his shoulders hunched. [3567] West Garden Director whispered to Zishizhou, \"What is a Trojan horse?\" [3568] Zishizhou lightly shook his head. [3569] The woman in the middle of the screen claimed to be the killer. [3570] Zishizhou and West Garden Director exchanged silent glances. Zishizhou raised one eyebrow, trying to make his expression asymmetrically uneven. [3571]4\n[3572] \"Can I speak?\" Kikuchi Doctor raised his right hand. \"What's going on? Who's the killer? Who is this person? Why are they pretending to be Doctor Ichijoji?\" [3573] \"I am Doctor Ichijoji,\" the woman on the white cat toy in the middle replied. [3574] \"You're not Doctor Ichijoji!\" Mizuki exclaimed. \"You... You're Dojuro, aren't you?\" [3575] \"It's the same...\" Doctor Ichijoji looked at Mizuki. [3576] \"You were in Doctor Higashida's room... All the time... Then you killed the doctor and ran out... Right? To get out, you killed Doctor Higashida. That's when we ran down the corridor chasing the doctor in the wedding dress's body. That's when you took the elevator