nce. [3587] White clouds flowed beneath everyone's feet. It could also be considered that they were moving at a certain speed. [3588] The car in the center position slowly rotated. [3589] \"Ms. Akari's daughter?\" G\u014dy\u01d2ng said, \"Born?\u2026\"\n[3590] \"Trojan horse\u2026\" S\u016bigu\u01d4 trembled and murmured to himself. [3591] The woman in the middle laughed. [3592] \"What's so funny, Doju-san?\" Wakaba stretched her right hand forward and said, \"You killed Dr. Akagi Four Seasons... Your mother, right?\" [3593] \"In a way... As you said, Ms. Nishiyama,\" Ms. Akagi replied in a gentle voice, as if comforting a crying baby. [3594] \"Yes, Ms. Nishiyama... Don't cry... You don't have to cry... I've never cried... It's strange to cry.\" [3595] \"You...,\" Wakaba's hoarse voice. She seemed to want to say something but couldn't speak through her tears. [3596] \"Hearing your voice like that is painful\u2026 Is there anything else you want to say?\" [3597] \"Yes\u2026\" Aoi's heavy breathing could be heard. \"Ah, you were born in that room\u2026 You, who have always\u2026 always\u2026 lived in that room. You never left\u2026 But you killed your mother\u2026\"\n[3598] \"Ms. Nishiyama, it's something all living beings allow. \" Dr. Shiki said gently, \"Please stop crying\u2026 It's just how life should be, it's fate\u2026 Flowers wither for new seeds, mothers die for new egg bodies\u2026 It's not something to be sad about.\" [3599] \"Born in that room?\" Dr. Komuro asked, \"Who's child?\" [3600] \"New Director Naito's, I suppose\u2026\" Aoi took a breath, \"Dr. Makoto Shiki and Director Naito's child\u2026 You killed your mother and her uncle. No, you killed your parents! Why? Why?\" [3601] \"It's all broken, Ms. Nishiyama.\" Mrs. Akagi's tone was slightly cold, \"I understand. I'll tell you the truth.\" [3602] Mrs. Akagi's white cat toy car rose slightly, and everyone looked up. [3603] \"Dr. True Spring was pregnant at the age of 14\u2026 The father was New Vineyard Shinji.\" It seemed like another personality had appeared, and Mrs. Akagi's tone became emotionless, as if she were reading a paper, \"She told her father, Dr. True Spring Left Lung, and her mother, Dr. True Spring Mei Chien. It was a child between her uncle and her. But she didn't understand. She happily told her parents\u2026 But she never imagined that because of that, her parents would be so shocked and angry. That's the background of the murder case fifteen years ago\u2026 It was the first time that season was beaten and scolded by her parents\u2026 She didn't know what she had done wrong. No one had taught her about such rules\u2026 Her parents scolded and beat her. How unreasonable!\" [3604] \"So you killed them?\" Momo asked. Her voice was a little calmer than before. [3605] \"No\u2026\" Mrs. Akagi answered in a gentle voice, \"New Vineyard Shinji killed Dr. True Spring Left Lung and Dr. True Spring Mei Chien. That's the uncle of True Spring\u2026 It's different from what the world generally believes, but it's what Season saw, so it's true\u2026 Season watched her uncle kill her parents\u2026\"\n[3606] \"Shikiri was the one who took out the knife, but suddenly she couldn't move. Mr. Shinobu Nagata hugged Shikiri, who was like a doll and couldn't move, from behind. He used both hands to hold Shikiri's hand that was holding the knife and stabbed Dr. Truefield Meiicho with it. Dr. Meiicho didn't even try to dodge. Shikiri watched everything happen in front of her. The knife was in Shikiri's hand. Her mother's warm blood splashed on Shikiri's face... Her mother's chest was stabbed, and she fell to the ground. Then, she hit the wall and slowly fell to the floor. She didn't say anything...\u201d\n[3607] \"Shikiri's hand holding the knife was being controlled by Mr. Shinobu Nagata's big hand. Shikiri was just a doll watching everything. She didn't even cry. They stabbed Dr. Truefield Kichijiro again... It was really simple. When Shikiri's father fell, her doll